const scenarios={exact:{name:'平衡',desc:'2× 纹理缩减 · 标准视觉与性能平衡',evidence:'文件声明',extra:'由 MPKG 内的 WallHub 版本化元数据精确识别。文件复制、重命名或跨设备导入后仍可保留此档位。'},inferred:{name:'高性能',desc:'4× 纹理缩减',evidence:'内容推断',extra:'外部 MPKG 未包含 WallHub 元数据；根据 scene.json 的 general.texturereduction=4 保守推断。'},ambiguous:{name:'原始分辨率',desc:'高质量或极致质量',evidence:'无法完全确认',extra:'内容表明未进行纹理缩减，但仅凭输出文件无法可靠区分高质量和极致质量。'},unknown:{name:'未知',desc:'未找到可验证的档位信息',evidence:'外部文件',extra:'该 MPKG 没有 WallHub 元数据，且场景设置不足以推断档位。文件仍可正常浏览和导入。'}};
function cover(w,extra=''){return `<div class="cover ${w.tone||''} ${extra}"></div>`}
function workshopCard(w,library=false){return `<button class="card workshop-card ${library?'library-card':''} clickable" data-route="detail" data-id="${w.id}">${cover(w)}<div class="card-body"><div class="card-title">${esc(w.title)}</div><div class="card-meta">${esc(w.author)} · ${w.type}</div><div class="stats"><span>订阅 ${w.subs}</span><span>收藏 ${w.fav}</span><span>${w.size}</span></div></div></button>`}
function topLevel(route){return ['home','discover','profile'].includes(route)?route:state.parentRoot}
function renderNav(){const active=topLevel(state.route);$('#nav').innerHTML=[['home','首页','home'],['discover','发现','discover'],['profile','我的','profile']].map(([r,l,i])=>`<button class="nav-btn ${active===r?'active':''}" data-root="${r}"><span class="nav-icon">${icon(i)}</span><span>${l}</span></button>`).join('')}
const routeTitles={home:'WallHub',discover:'发现',profile:'我的',detail:'壁纸详情',downloads:'下载',local:'本地','local-detail':'本地壁纸',library:'我的订阅',settings:'设置','settings-general':'常规','settings-appearance':'外观','settings-downloads':'下载','settings-steam':'Steam','settings-about':'关于 WallHub',login:'登录 Steam','discover-results':'浏览结果',following:'我的关注','query-editor':'添加关注',player:'视频播放',setup:'欢迎使用 WallHub'};
function renderTopbar(){const isRoot=['home','discover','profile'].includes(state.route),hide=['player','setup'].includes(state.route);$('#app').classList.toggle('fullscreen',hide);$('#app').classList.toggle('secondary',!isRoot&&!hide);$('#topbar').hidden=hide;if(hide)return;let actions='',title=`<h1 class="topbar-title">${esc(routeTitles[state.route]||'WallHub')}</h1>`;if(state.route==='home'){title=`<div class="title-stack"><div><strong>WallHub</strong><span>steam-community</span></div><small>已加载 30 · 约 2541127 项 · 第 1/1000 页</small></div>`;actions=`${ib(state.homeView==='grid'?'list':'grid','切换视图','__view')}`;}else if(state.route==='discover'){title='<button class="tonal" data-route="following">▣　你的内容　⌄</button>';actions='';}else if(state.route==='profile')actions=ib('settings','设置','settings');else if(state.route==='library')actions=`${ib('search','搜索','!librarySearch')}${ib('filter','筛选','__filter')}${ib('refresh','刷新','!refresh')}`;else if(state.route==='local')actions=`${ib('search','搜索','!localSearch')}${ib('refresh','刷新','!refresh')}${ib('more','更多','__localMenu')}`;else if(state.route==='downloads')actions=`${ib('filter','类型筛选','__downloadFilter')}${ib('refresh','重试全部失败','!retryAll')}${ib('trash','清除完成记录','!clearHistory')}`;else if(state.route==='settings')actions='';else if(state.route==='detail')actions=ib('heart','收藏','!favorite');else if(state.route==='local-detail')actions=ib('heart','收藏','!favoriteLocal');$('#topbar').innerHTML=`${isRoot?'':ib('back','返回','__back')}${title}${actions}`}
function ib(name,label,hook=''){const attr=!hook?'':hook.startsWith('!')?`data-action="${hook.slice(1)}"`:`data-route="${hook}"`;return `<button class="icon-btn" aria-label="${label}" ${attr}>${icon(name)}</button>`}
function render(){document.documentElement.dataset.theme=state.theme;renderNav();renderTopbar();const fn=pages[state.route]||pages.home;$('#viewport').innerHTML=fn();bind();window.scrollTo(0,0)}
function routeSnapshot(route,data={}){return {route,parentRoot:['home','discover','profile'].includes(route)?route:state.parentRoot,selectedId:data.selectedId??state.selectedId,selectedLocal:data.selectedLocal??state.selectedLocal}}
function navigate(route,data={}){if(route===state.route)return;const snap=routeSnapshot(route,data);Object.assign(state,snap,data);history.pushState(snap,'',`#${route}`);render()}
function root(route){const snap={route,parentRoot:route};Object.assign(state,snap);history.pushState(snap,'',`#${route}`);render()}
function back(){if(history.state?.route&&history.length>1)history.back();else{Object.assign(state,{route:'home',parentRoot:'home'});history.replaceState(routeSnapshot('home'),'','#home');render()}}
function bind(){ $$('[data-route]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>{if(x.dataset.action)actions[x.dataset.action]?.(x);const r=x.dataset.route;if(r==='__back')back();else if(r==='__view')actions.toggleView();else if(r==='__filter')actions.openFilter();else if(r==='__localMenu')actions.localMenu();else if(r==='__downloadFilter')actions.downloadFilter();else navigate(r,{selectedId:Number(x.dataset.id)||state.selectedId,selectedLocal:Number.isFinite(Number(x.dataset.local))?Number(x.dataset.local):state.selectedLocal})});$$('[data-root]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>root(x.dataset.root));$$('[data-action]:not([data-route])').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>actions[x.dataset.action]?.(x));}
function toast(msg){const t=$('#toast');t.textContent=msg;t.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(toast._t);toast._t=setTimeout(()=>t.classList.remove('show'),2200)}
function modal(content,type='modal'){const o=$('#overlay');o.innerHTML=`<div class="modal-layer"><div class="${type}">${type==='sheet'?'<div class="handle"></div>':''}${content}</div></div>`;o.querySelector('.modal-layer').onclick=e=>{if(e.target===e.currentTarget)o.innerHTML=''};bind()}
function closeModal(){$('#overlay').innerHTML=''}
const pages={
 home(){return `<div class="page wide"><div class="section-title"><h2>创意工坊</h2><span class="subtitle">已加载 30 · 第 1/1000 页</span></div>${state.homeView==='grid'?`<div class="hero-grid">${wallpapers.map(workshopCard).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="list">${wallpapers.map(w=>`<button class="card list-row clickable" data-route="detail" data-id="${w.id}">${cover(w)}<span><div class="card-title">${w.title}</div><div class="card-meta">${w.author} · ${w.type} · ${w.size}</div><div class="stats"><span>订阅 ${w.subs}</span><span>收藏 ${w.fav}</span></div></span><span class="trailing">${icon('download')}</span></button>`).join('')}</div>`}<div class="pager"><button class="active">1</button><button>2</button><button>3</button></div><button class="fab" data-action="homeSearch" aria-label="搜索创意工坊">${icon('search')}</button></div>`},
 discover(){const rails=[['为你推荐',wallpapers.slice(0,4)],['本周热门',wallpapers.slice(2,6)],['动态场景',wallpapers.slice(1,5)],['精选创作者',wallpapers.slice(0,5)]];return `<div class="page wide">${rails.map(([t,a],idx)=>`<section><div class="section-title"><h2>${t}</h2><button class="text-btn" data-route="discover-results">查看全部</button></div><div class="rail">${a.map(workshopCard).join('')}</div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:4px;padding:0 16px"><button class="icon-btn" data-action="railLike" aria-label="喜欢">♡</button><button class="icon-btn" data-action="railDislike" aria-label="不喜欢">⌄</button><button class="icon-btn" data-action="railFavorite" aria-label="收藏">☆</button></div></section>`).join('')}</div>`},
 profile(){return `<div class="page"><div class="profile-head"><div class="avatar">W</div><h1 class="headline">WallHub 预览账号</h1><div class="subtitle">已记录的 Wallpaper 运行时长 134 小时</div></div><div class="stat-grid"><button class="card stat clickable" data-route="library" data-action="subscriptions"><div><strong>39</strong><div class="label">我的订阅</div></div></button><button class="card stat clickable" data-route="library" data-action="favorites"><div><strong>2</strong><div class="label">我的收藏</div></div></button></div><div class="list" style="margin-top:16px"><button class="card entry clickable" data-route="downloads">${icon('download')}<span class="entry-copy"><div class="title">下载管理</div><div class="subtitle">管理下载任务</div></span></button><button class="card entry clickable" data-route="local">${icon('folder')}<span class="entry-copy"><div class="title">本地壁纸</div><div class="subtitle">管理设备上的壁纸</div></span></button></div></div>`},
 detail(){const w=wallpapers.find(x=>x.id===state.selectedId)||wallpapers[0];return `<div class="page"><article class="detail">${cover(w,'detail-cover')}<h1 class="headline">${w.title}</h1><div class="subtitle">${w.author} · ${w.type} · Workshop ${w.id}</div><div class="action-row"><button class="filled" data-action="queue">${icon('download')} 下载</button><button class="icon-btn card" aria-label="订阅" data-action="subscribe">${icon('add')}</button><button class="icon-btn card" aria-label="收藏" data-action="favorite">${icon('heart')}</button></div><div class="tabs two"><button class="tab ${state.detailTab==='details'?'active':''}" data-action="detailDetails">详情</button><button class="tab ${state.detailTab==='comments'?'active':''}" data-action="detailComments">评论</button></div>${state.detailTab==='details'?detailInfo(w):comments()}</article></div>`},
 downloads(){const active=[{t:'Aurora Glass',p:72,s:'18.4 MB/s · 256 / 354 MB',status:'正在下载'}, {t:'City Rain',p:100,s:'转换纹理 18 · Shader 11',status:'正在转换'}, {t:'Forest Clock',p:35,s:'等待网络恢复',status:'已暂停'}],done=[{t:'麻匪 月半与鬼哭',s:'94.9 MB · 高质量',status:'已完成'},{t:'Rhine Lab',s:'48.3 MB · 平衡',status:'已完成'}];const list=state.downloadTab==='active'?active:done;return `<div class="page"><div class="tabs two"><button class="tab ${state.downloadTab==='active'?'active':''}" data-action="downloadsActive">下载中</button><button class="tab ${state.downloadTab==='completed'?'active':''}" data-action="downloadsCompleted">已完成</button></div><div class="list" style="margin-top:12px">${list.map((x,i)=>`<div class="card download-row"><span class="cover task-thumb c${i%4+1}"></span><div class="task-content"><div class="status-line"><div class="card-title">${x.t}</div><span class="small">${x.status}</span><button class="icon-btn" data-action="downloadMenu">${icon('more')}</button></div><div class="card-meta">${x.s}</div>${x.p!=null?`<div class="progress"><span style="width:${x.p}%"></span></div>`:''}${state.downloadTab==='completed'?`<div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px"><button class="tonal" data-action="play">${icon('play')} 播放</button><button class="outlined" data-action="reconvert">重新转换</button></div>`:''}</div></div>`).join('')}</div></div>`},
 local(){return `<div class="page"><div class="section-title"><h2>设备上的壁纸</h2><span class="subtitle">4 个资源</span></div><div class="list">${localItems.map((x,i)=>`<button class="card list-row clickable" data-route="local-detail" data-local="${i}"><span class="cover ${x.tone}"></span><span><div class="card-title">${x.title}</div><div class="card-meta">${x.meta}</div></span><span class="trailing">${icon('phone')}</span></button>`).join('')}</div></div>`},
 'local-detail'(){const i=state.selectedLocal??0,x=localItems[i],s=scenarios[x.scenario];return `<div class="page"><article class="detail">${cover(x,'detail-cover')}<div class="action-row"><button class="filled">导入 Wallpaper Engine</button><div class="utility-group"><button class="icon-btn" data-action="share" aria-label="分享">${icon('share')}</button><button class="icon-btn" data-action="copyLocation" aria-label="复制位置">${icon('folder')}</button><button class="icon-btn danger" data-action="deleteLocal" aria-label="删除">${icon('trash')}</button></div></div><button class="outlined" data-route="detail" data-id="3299228616" style="width:100%;margin-bottom:12px">查看壁纸详情</button><div class="tier-panel"><div class="small">转换档位 · 未来功能提案（非当前 Compose 界面）</div><div class="tier-row"><span class="tier-glyph">${icon('info')}</span><span class="tier-copy"><div class="title">${s.name}</div><div class="subtitle">${s.desc}</div></span><span class="evidence">${s.evidence}</span></div><p class="tier-extra">${s.extra}</p><button class="text-btn" data-action="tierCompare">比较识别状态</button></div><div class="info-section"><div class="title">文件信息</div>${[['格式','MPKG · Scene'],['检测','已检查 MPKG 索引'],['大小',x.size],['来源','Download/WallHub'],['位置',x.file],['转换档位',s.name],['创意工坊 ID','3299228616'],['导入状态','尚未导入']].map(([a,b])=>`<div class="detail-line"><span class="detail-label">${a}</span><span class="detail-value">${b}</span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="section-title"><h2>标签</h2><button class="text-btn">添加</button></div><div class="chips"><button class="chip">场景 ×</button><button class="chip">动态壁纸 ×</button></div></article></div>`},
 library(){const items=state.library==='subscriptions'?wallpapers.slice(0,5):wallpapers.slice(4,6);return `<div class="page wide"><div class="tabs two"><button class="tab ${state.library==='subscriptions'?'active':''}" data-action="libSubs">我的订阅</button><button class="tab ${state.library==='favorites'?'active':''}" data-action="libFavs">我的收藏</button></div>${state.librarySearch?`<div class="searchbar">${icon('back')}<input autofocus placeholder="搜索已收藏或订阅的壁纸"><button class="icon-btn" data-action="librarySearch">${icon('close')}</button></div>`:''}<div class="hero-grid">${items.map(x=>workshopCard(x,true)).join('')}</div></div>`},
 settings(){return `<div class="page"><div class="list">${settingsIndexRow('常规','内容访问、通知和诊断','settings-general')}${settingsIndexRow('外观','主题、强调色和发现偏好','settings-appearance')}${settingsIndexRow('下载','导出目录、并发与代理','settings-downloads')}${settingsIndexRow('Steam','账号、服务访问和创意工坊数据源','settings-steam')}${settingsIndexRow('关于 WallHub for Android','版本、更新、项目和贡献者信息','settings-about')}</div></div>`},
 'settings-general'(){return settingsPage('常规',`${setting('应用语言','跟随系统','language')}${setting('导出诊断日志','已脱敏的设备、网络、耗时和错误链','export')}${setting('NSFW 内容','开启前请了解该内容的含义','switch')}${setting('后台任务通知','显示下载、转换和导出实时进度','permission')}`)},
 'settings-appearance'(){return settingsPage('外观',`${setting('主题模式','跟随系统','theme')}${setting('系统动态颜色','使用壁纸调色板','switchOn')}${setting('主题化应用图标','Android 13 或更高版本','switchOn')}${setting('静态调色板','默认','palette')}${setting('每页项目数','30','page')}${setting('分页','无限滚动','pagination')}${setting('手机列数','2','columns')}${setting('悬浮首页搜索','开启','switchOn')}${setting('默认卡片操作','下载','action')}<button class="outlined" data-action="theme" style="width:100%;margin-top:12px">预览明暗主题</button>`)},
 'settings-downloads'(){return settingsPage('下载',`${setting('当前导出目录','Download/WallHub','folder')}${setting('选择自定义目录','使用 Android 系统目录授权','choose')}${setting('默认转换质量','高质量（默认）','tier')}${setting('保留已下载源文件','用于重新转换','switchOn')}${setting('请求的源缓存预算','5 GiB','cache')}${setting('当前保留','1.2 GiB','retained')}${setting('并发下载','2','concurrent')}${setting('每个下载的分块数','8','chunks')}${setting('Steam 分块流式播放','开启','switchOn')}${setting('使用网络代理','关闭','switch')}<div class="field"><label>HTTP(S) / SOCKS5 代理</label><input placeholder="socks5://127.0.0.1:1080"></div><button class="filled" data-action="saveProxy" style="width:100%">保存代理设置</button>`)},
 'settings-steam'(){return settingsPage('Steam',`<div class="banner"><div class="title">WallHub 预览账号</div><div class="subtitle">Steam 已连接 · 资料库和评论可用</div></div>${setting('自动防阻断','当前网络可直连','switchOn')}<button class="setting card clickable" data-action="dohSheet">${icon('settings')}<span class="copy"><div class="label">DoH 线路</div><div class="subtitle">已启用 30/30；点击管理自动选择</div></span><span>›</span></button>${setting('数据源','Steam Community HTML','source')}<button class="outlined danger" data-action="logout" style="width:100%;margin-top:12px">退出 Steam 登录</button>`)},
 'settings-about'(){return `<div class="page"><div class="profile-head"><div class="avatar">W</div><h1 class="headline">WallHub For Android</h1><p class="subtitle">开源的 Wallpaper Engine 创意工坊浏览、下载与移动端管理工具。</p></div><div class="settings-group"><h2>开发者</h2>${setting('CHENLEO_7','项目作者','profile')}${setting('uwugl','核心贡献者','profile')}</div><div class="settings-group"><h2>更新</h2>${setting('检查更新','当前版本 0.9.0 (35)','update')}${setting('更新时间','2026-10-28','date')}${setting('GitHub 仓库','查看源代码和 Release','github')}${setting('QQ 社区群','加入社区讨论','group')}</div><button class="outlined" data-route="setup" style="width:100%">重新运行设置向导</button></div>`},
 login(){return `<div class="page"><div class="banner"><div class="title">Steam 登录状态</div><div class="subtitle">已连接 WallHub 预览账号；Web 原型不会发送凭据。</div></div><div class="field"><label>Steam 用户名</label><input value="wallhub-preview"></div><div class="field"><label>密码</label><input type="password" value="placeholder"></div><button class="filled" data-action="login" style="width:100%">登录 Steam</button><div class="divider"></div><button class="outlined danger" data-action="logout" style="width:100%">退出登录</button></div>`},
 following(){return `<div class="page"><div class="banner"><div class="title">关注的查询</div><div class="subtitle">保存创作者、合集和关键词，快速查看最新内容。</div></div><div class="list">${['重点创作者','赛博朋克合集','动态天气','像素艺术'].map(x=>`<button class="card entry clickable" data-route="discover-results"><span class="entry-copy"><div class="title">${x}</div><div class="subtitle">最近更新 · 20 个结果</div></span><span>›</span></button>`).join('')}</div><button class="fab" data-route="query-editor" aria-label="添加关注">${icon('add')}</button></div>`},
 'query-editor'(){return `<div class="page"><div class="field"><label>名称</label><input placeholder="例如：精选像素艺术"></div><div class="field"><label>查询类型</label><select><option>关键词</option><option>创作者</option><option>合集</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>搜索内容</label><input placeholder="输入关键词或 ID"></div><div class="field"><label>壁纸类型</label><div class="chips"><button class="chip selected">场景</button><button class="chip">视频</button><button class="chip">网页</button></div></div><button class="filled" data-action="saveQuery" style="width:100%">保存并查看结果</button></div>`},
 'discover-results'(){return `<div class="page wide"><div class="searchbar">${icon('search')}<input value="精选壁纸"></div><div class="filter-row"><button class="chip selected">趋势</button><button class="chip">最近 30 天</button><button class="chip">场景</button><button class="chip">移动端兼容</button></div><div class="hero-grid">${wallpapers.map(workshopCard).join('')}</div><div class="pager"><button class="active">1</button><button>2</button><button>3</button></div></div>`},
 player(){return `<div class="player"><button class="icon-btn" data-route="__back" style="position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;color:#fff">${icon('back')}</button><div class="player-ui">${icon('play')}<h2>视频预览</h2><p>此 Web 镜像使用占位播放器</p></div></div>`},
 setup(){return setupPage()}
};
function detailInfo(w){return `<div class="info-section"><div class="title">关于此壁纸</div><p class="subtitle" style="line-height:1.6">来自 Steam 创意工坊的高质量 ${w.type} 壁纸。支持移动端预览、下载与转换为 Wallpaper Engine Android 可导入的 MPKG。</p>${[['作者',w.author],['类型',w.type],['文件大小',w.size],['订阅',w.subs],['收藏',w.fav],['Workshop ID',w.id]].map(([a,b])=>`<div class="detail-line"><span class="detail-label">${a}</span><span class="detail-value">${b}</span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="section-title"><h2>标签</h2></div><div class="chips"><button class="chip">动态</button><button class="chip">4K</button><button class="chip">放松</button><button class="chip">自定义</button></div>`}
function comments(){return `<div class="comments" style="margin-top:12px">${[['SteamUser_01','画面和音频响应都很流畅。'],['TerraDoctor','移动端效果很好，感谢分享！'],['WallpaperFan','希望增加更多自定义选项。']].map(([u,t])=>`<div class="card comment"><div class="comment-head"><span class="mini-avatar"></span><span><div class="label">${u}</div><div class="small">2026-10-27</div></span></div><p>${t}</p><button class="text-btn">回复</button></div>`).join('')}<div class="searchbar"><input placeholder="写评论"><button class="icon-btn" data-action="postComment">${icon('share')}</button></div></div>`}
function setting(title,sub,type){const glyph=icon(type==='folder'?'folder':type==='theme'?'sun':type==='tier'?'info':'settings');if(type==='switch'||type==='switchOn')return `<div class="setting card">${glyph}<span class="copy"><div class="label">${title}</div><div class="subtitle">${sub}</div></span><button class="switch ${type==='switchOn'?'on':''}" data-action="toggleSwitch"></button></div>`;if(['retained','date'].includes(type))return `<div class="setting card">${glyph}<span class="copy"><div class="label">${title}</div><div class="subtitle">${sub}</div></span></div>`;return `<button class="setting card clickable" data-action="settingChoice" data-label="${esc(title)}">${glyph}<span class="copy"><div class="label">${title}</div><div class="subtitle">${sub}</div></span><span>›</span></button>`}
function settingsIndexRow(title,sub,route){return `<button class="setting card clickable" data-route="${route}">${icon('settings')}<span class="copy"><div class="label">${title}</div><div class="subtitle">${sub}</div></span><span>›</span></button>`}
function settingsPage(title,body){return `<div class="page"><div class="settings-group"><h2>${title}</h2>${body}</div></div>`}
const setupSteps=[
 {title:'欢迎使用 WallHub',desc:'在 Android 上浏览、下载与管理 Wallpaper Engine 创意工坊内容。',body:'<div class="setup-logo">W</div>'},
 {title:'网络设置',desc:'设置网络代理、服务访问线路、创意工坊数据源和 Web API Key。',body:`${setting('使用网络代理','HTTP(S) / SOCKS5 代理','switch')}${setting('自动防阻断','在直连不完整时增强连接','switchOn')}${setting('DoH 线路','已启用 30/30','route')}`},
 {title:'连接检测',desc:'失败仅作为警告，不会阻止完成设置。',body:`<div class="list">${['Directory（CM 发现）','公开详情 JSON','社区 HTML','创意工坊图片','GitHub API','壁纸策展 API'].map((x,i)=>`<div class="setting card"><span class="copy"><div class="label">${x}</div><div class="subtitle">${i===4?'连接失败':'检测通过'}</div></span><span class="${i===4?'danger':''}">${i===4?'失败':(820+i*113)+' ms'}</span></div>`).join('')}</div>`},
 {title:'保存位置',desc:'设置创意工坊文件下载、MPKG 导出和本地扫描使用的目录。',body:`<div class="banner"><div class="label">当前保存位置</div><div class="subtitle">默认：Download/WallHub</div></div><button class="outlined" data-action="systemPicker" style="width:100%">选择并授权目录</button>`},
 {title:'登录 Steam',desc:'连接 Steam 账户，以访问资料库、评论和需要登录的创意工坊功能。',body:`<div class="field"><label>Steam 用户名</label><input></div><div class="field"><label>密码</label><input type="password"></div>`},
 {title:'设置完成',desc:'WallHub 已准备就绪。之后仍可在设置中修改这些选项。',body:'<div class="setup-logo">✓</div>'}
];
function setupPage(){const s=setupSteps[state.setupStep];return `<div class="setup">${s.body}<h1>${s.title}</h1><p>${s.desc}</p><div class="setup-actions">${state.setupStep?'<button class="text-btn" data-action="setupPrev">返回</button>':''}<button class="filled" data-action="setupNext">${state.setupStep===setupSteps.length-1?'开始使用 WallHub':state.setupStep===4?'暂时跳过':'下一步'}</button></div></div>`}
const actions={
 search(){toast('搜索界面已在对应页面复刻')},refresh(){toast('内容已刷新')},retryAll(){toast('已重试全部失败任务')},clearHistory(){toast('已清除完成记录')},favorite(){toast('收藏状态已更新')},subscribe(){toast('订阅状态已更新')},favoriteLocal(){toast('本地收藏状态已更新')},railLike(el){el.textContent=el.textContent==='♥'?'♡':'♥'},railDislike(){toast('已降低此主题的推荐权重')},railFavorite(el){el.textContent=el.textContent==='★'?'☆':'★'},localSearch(){toast('已展开本地搜索')},librarySearch(){state.librarySearch=!state.librarySearch;render()},homeSearch(){modal(`<div class="searchbar">${icon('search')}<input autofocus placeholder="搜索创意工坊"><button class="icon-btn" data-action="closeModal">${icon('close')}</button></div><button class="filled" data-action="openHomeFilter" style="width:100%">${icon('filter')} 打开创意工坊筛选</button>`,'sheet')},openHomeFilter(){closeModal();modal(`<h2>创意工坊筛选</h2><p class="subtitle">排序、时间、类型、分级、题材、分辨率和功能</p>${['排序：趋势','时间：最近 30 天','类型：全部','分级：所有年龄','题材：全部','分辨率：全部','功能：未选择'].map(x=>`<div class="setting card"><span class="copy"><div class="label">${x}</div></span><span>⌄</span></div>`).join('')}<div class="modal-actions"><button class="text-btn" data-action="closeModal">重置</button><button class="filled" data-action="closeModal">应用筛选</button></div>`,'sheet')},toggleView(){state.homeView=state.homeView==='grid'?'list':'grid';render()},openFilter(){modal(`<h2>资料库筛选</h2><p class="subtitle">类型、分级、题材、分辨率与功能标签</p>${['类型：场景 / 视频 / 网页','分级：所有年龄','题材：全部','分辨率：全部','精确短语'].map(x=>`<div class="setting card"><span class="copy"><div class="label">${x}</div></span><button class="switch" data-action="toggleSwitch"></button></div>`).join('')}<div class="modal-actions"><button class="text-btn" data-action="closeModal">重置</button><button class="filled" data-action="closeModal">应用筛选</button></div>`,'sheet')},localMenu(){modal(`<button class="setting card"><span class="copy"><div class="label">选择扫描目录</div></span></button><button class="setting card"><span class="copy"><div class="label">管理标签</div></span></button>`,'sheet')},downloadFilter(){modal(`<h2>筛选下载类型</h2>${['视频','场景','网页'].map(x=>`<div class="setting card"><span class="copy"><div class="label">${x}</div></span><button class="switch on" data-action="toggleSwitch"></button></div>`).join('')}`,'sheet')},dohSheet(){modal(`<h2>DoH 线路</h2><p class="subtitle">自动选择 · 30/30 已启用</p>${['阿里 DNS','腾讯 DNSPod','Cloudflare','Google Public DNS'].map((x,i)=>`<div class="setting card"><span class="copy"><div class="label">${x}</div><div class="subtitle">${i<2?'国内和区域':'国际'} · ${28+i*17} ms</div></span><button class="switch on" data-action="toggleSwitch"></button></div>`).join('')}<div class="modal-actions"><button class="text-btn" data-action="closeModal">取消</button><button class="filled" data-action="closeModal">保存更改</button></div>`,'sheet')},queue(){modal(`<h2>下载选项</h2><p class="subtitle">选择适合 Wallpaper Engine Android 或保留原始文件的格式。</p><button class="filled" data-action="mpkgOptions" style="width:100%;margin:8px 0">MPKG · 移动端</button><button class="outlined" data-action="zipDownload" style="width:100%">ZIP · 原始文件</button>`,'sheet')},mpkgOptions(){closeModal();actions.reconvert()},zipDownload(){closeModal();toast('ZIP 已加入下载队列')},play(){navigate('player')},share(){toast('已打开系统分享')},copyLocation(){toast('已复制文件位置')},detailDetails(){state.detailTab='details';render()},detailComments(){state.detailTab='comments';render()},postComment(){toast('评论已发布')},downloadsActive(){state.downloadTab='active';render()},downloadsCompleted(){state.downloadTab='completed';render()},downloadMenu(){modal(`<h2>下载任务</h2><button class="setting card" data-action="pauseTask">暂停任务</button><button class="setting card danger" data-action="cancelTask">取消任务</button>`,'sheet')},pauseTask(){closeModal();toast('任务已暂停')},cancelTask(){closeModal();toast('任务已取消')},reconvert(){modal(`<h2>重新转换 MPKG</h2><p class="subtitle">选择转换档位和音频策略</p>${['高性能','平衡','高质量','极致质量'].map((x,i)=>`<div class="setting card"><span class="copy"><div class="label">${x}</div><div class="subtitle">${['4× 纹理缩减','2× 纹理缩减','原始分辨率','原分辨率 · 保真优先'][i]}</div></span><span class="radio ${i===2?'on':''}"></span></div>`).join('')}<div class="modal-actions"><button class="text-btn" data-action="closeModal">取消</button><button class="filled" data-action="confirmConvert">开始转换</button></div>`,'sheet')},closeModal,confirmConvert(){closeModal();toast('已开始重新转换')},tierCompare(){modal(`<h2>比较转换档位状态</h2><p class="subtitle">选择后更新当前详情页。</p>${Object.entries(scenarios).map(([k,s])=>`<button class="setting card clickable" data-action="pickTier" data-key="${k}"><span class="copy"><div class="label">${s.name} · ${s.evidence}</div><div class="subtitle">${s.extra}</div></span></button>`).join('')}`,'sheet')},pickTier(el){localItems[state.selectedLocal??0].scenario=el.dataset.key;closeModal();render()},deleteLocal(){modal('<h2>删除本地壁纸？</h2><p>此操作会删除已选择的本地文件。</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="text-btn" data-action="closeModal">取消</button><button class="text-btn danger" data-action="confirmDelete">删除</button></div>')},confirmDelete(){closeModal();toast('原型：文件已删除')},libSubs(){state.library='subscriptions';render()},libFavs(){state.library='favorites';render()},subscriptions(){state.library='subscriptions'},favorites(){state.library='favorites'},toggleSwitch(el){el.classList.toggle('on')},settingChoice(el){const label=el.dataset.label||'设置';modal(`<h2>${label}</h2>${['跟随系统','推荐设置','自定义'].map((x,i)=>`<button class="setting card clickable" data-action="applyChoice"><span class="copy"><div class="label">${x}</div></span><span class="radio ${i===0?'on':''}"></span></button>`).join('')}<div class="modal-actions"><button class="text-btn" data-action="closeModal">取消</button></div>`)},applyChoice(){closeModal();toast('设置已更新')},saveProxy(){toast('代理设置已保存')},systemPicker(){toast('原型：已打开 Android 目录选择器')},theme(){state.theme=state.theme==='dark'?'light':'dark';render()},login(){toast('原型：Steam 登录成功')},logout(){toast('原型：已退出登录')},saveQuery(){toast('已保存关注');navigate('discover-results')},setupPrev(){state.setupStep=Math.max(0,state.setupStep-1);render()},setupNext(){if(state.setupStep===setupSteps.length-1){state.setupStep=0;root('home')}else{state.setupStep++;render()}}
};
window.addEventListener('popstate',e=>{const snap=e.state||{route:'home',parentRoot:'home'};Object.assign(state,snap);render()});
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'){if($('#overlay').innerHTML)closeModal();else back()}});
const initialRoute=location.hash.slice(1)&&pages[location.hash.slice(1)]?location.hash.slice(1):'home';Object.assign(state,{route:initialRoute,parentRoot:['home','discover','profile'].includes(initialRoute)?initialRoute:'home'});history.replaceState(routeSnapshot(initialRoute),'',`#${initialRoute}`);render();
